# The agent pins its pull request: the sidebar shows it at once.
pin https://github.com/acme/web/pull/501 Settings: contrast fixes
expect #501 Settings: contrast fixes
wait 1200
hover Theme tokens
wait 600
unpin Theme tokens
expect-not Theme tokens
wait 600
type /links
key Enter
expect Pinned links
wait 1200
key down
wait 400
key ctrl+d
expect-not #482
wait 1200
key Escape
expect-not Pinned links
type /pin https://acme.atlassian.net/browse/OPS-42 Rotate keys
wait 400
key Enter
expect OPS-42 Rotate keys
wait 800
right Rotate keys
expect Open in browser
wait 1500
key Escape
